THEORY Ex4Q2
IMPORT-THEORY Equality
IMPORT-THEORY Boolean
IMPORT-THEORY Arithmetic
IMPORT-THEORY List
IMPORT-HASKELL List
IMPORT-HASKELL Ex4

THEOREM ex4q2

   rec2ursFunc 18 == 37

STRATEGY ReduceLHS

   rec2ursFunc 18
   = DEF rec2ursFunc
   if 18 <= 8 then 6 else 18 + rec2ursFunc (18 - 5)
   = SIMP
   if False then 6 else 18 + rec2ursFunc 13
   = IF 2
   18 + rec2ursFunc 13
   = DEF rec2ursFunc
   18 + (if 13 <= 8 then 6 else 13 + rec2ursFunc (13 - 5))
   = SIMP
   18 + (if False then 6 else 13 + rec2ursFunc 8)
   = IF 2
   18 + (13 + rec2ursFunc 8)
   = DEF rec2ursFunc
   18 + (13 + (if 8 <= 8 then 6 else 8 + rec2ursFunc (8 - 5)))
   = SIMP
   18 + (13 + (if True then 6 else 8 + rec2ursFunc 3))
   = IF 1
   18 + (13 + 6)
   = SIMP
   37

END ReduceLHS

QED ex4q2

